            "title": "Certification Breakdown",
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"tab-content-desc-wp\">\n            <div class=\"content\">\n              <div class=\"content_item content-item-1\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0005/4447/3203/files/logo_product_tabs_4.png?v=1694547276\" alt=\"\">\n                <div class=\"content_text\">\n                  <h4>Glyphosate Residue Free:</h4>\n                  <p>Every batch of Manukora honey is 3rd-party tested and verified free from any toxins, pesticides, and glyphosates. All traceable through our unique QR code system on each product.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"content_item content-item-2\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0005/4447/3203/files/logo_product_tabs_2.png?v=1694547276\" alt=\"\">\n                <div class=\"content_text\">\n                  <h4>Third Party Tested:</h4>\n                  <p>All our Mānuka honey undergo rigorous testing by independent labs to verify the MGO levels and potency of Mānuka while ensuring all other bioactive compounds are accounted for.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"content_item content-item-3\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0005/4447/3203/files/logo_product_tab_3.png?v=1694553035\" alt=\"\">\n                <div class=\"content_text\">\n                  <h4>Certified B Corporation:</h4>\n                  <p>Manukora is proudly B-Corp Certified. We've forged strong ties with expert beekeepers in remote New Zealand. Together, we're shaping a business that cares for bees, their homes, and fosters local community bonds.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"content_item content-item-4\">\n                <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0005/4447/3203/files/logo_product_tabs_1.png?v=1694547276\" alt=\"\">\n                <div class=\"content_text\">\n                  <h4>Non GMO Verified:</h4>\n                  <p>Our Mānuka honey is ethically harvested and produced, all GMO-free verified by the Non-GMO Project.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>"
          }
        }
